  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Requiring maven to use the migration-utils makes it less approachable.  ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Create a packaging that's easier to use, like a executable jar.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If possible, the configuration options could allow you to specify a spring xml configuration (either from a couple pre-configured or a custom one).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Of the pre-set configuration options, maybe we want to expose enough optional parameters to allow configuration of the most variable components.  ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The following seem to be the most likely simple parameters that would be overridden:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "1.  the destination fedora 4 repository URL",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2.  the source foxml directory and datastream store",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If you think other things should be simplified, please write up tickets for those prerequisite simplifications.  (ie, we could auto-detect the fedora 4 source files if you thought that were a barrier)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
