     "body": "<p>Here is a very simple implementation that allows the userto run the jar file with a provided Spring XML:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/migration-utils/pull/19\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/migration-utils/pull/19</a></p>\n\n<p>We could also abstract the XML into a properties file, but that would introduce a new class for translating the properties into the appropriate classes. </p>",
     "created": "21/May/15 10:23 PM",
