  "description": "<p>Requiring maven to use the migration-utils makes it less approachable.  </p>\n\n<p>Create a packaging that's easier to use, like a executable jar.</p>\n\n<p>If possible, the configuration options could allow you to specify a spring xml configuration (either from a couple pre-configured or a custom one).</p>\n\n<p>Of the pre-set configuration options, maybe we want to expose enough optional parameters to allow configuration of the most variable components.  </p>\n\n<p>The following seem to be the most likely simple parameters that would be overridden:</p>\n\n<p>1.  the destination fedora 4 repository URL<br/>\n2.  the source foxml directory and datastream store</p>\n\n<p>If you think other things should be simplified, please write up tickets for those prerequisite simplifications.  (ie, we could auto-detect the fedora 4 source files if you thought that were a barrier)</p>\n",
